
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>NEXORA LIFE | One Platform. Infinite Possibilities.</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{background:#080b16;color:#fff;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;min-height:100vh}
header{padding:22px 7%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid #20253b}
.logo{font-size:25px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;color:#8b9cff}
.logo span{color:#fff}
nav a{color:#c5c9dc;text-decoration:none;margin-left:20px;font-size:14px}
.hero{text-align:center;padding:85px 20px 55px}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(38px,8vw,70px);margin-bottom:18px}
.hero h1 span{color:#8b9cff}
.hero p{color:#aeb5ca;line-height:1.7;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto 28px}
.btn{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#596bff,#a15cff);color:white;border:0;padding:14px 25px;border-radius:9px;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer}
.section{padding:35px 7% 75px}
.section h2{text-align:center;font-size:30px;margin-bottom:12px}
.sub{text-align:center;color:#9ba4bd;margin-bottom:35px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:18px}
.card{background:#11182b;border:1px solid #293453;border-radius:15px;padding:25px;transition:.25s}
.card:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);border-color:#8995ff}
.card .emoji{font-size:30px;margin-bottom:16px}
.card h3{margin-bottom:10px}
.card p{color:#aab2c8;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:18px}
.card button{background:#26345e;color:#fff;border:1px solid #5063a5;padding:10px 15px;border-radius:7px;cursor:pointer}
footer{text-align:center;padding:25px;color:#7f8aa7;border-top:1px solid #20253b;font-size:13px}
#message{margin-top:22px;color:#aebaff;min-height:24px;text-align:center}
@media(max-width:600px){nav a{margin-left:9px;font-size:12px}.hero{padding-top:65px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<div class="logo">NEXORA <span>LIFE</span></div>
<nav>
<a href="#home">Home</a>
<a href="#platforms">Platforms</a>
</nav>
</header>

<main>
<section class="hero" id="home">
<h1>One Platform.<br><span>Infinite Possibilities.</span></h1>
<p>Welcome to NEXORA LIFE — a connected digital ecosystem for artificial intelligence, creativity, learning, productivity and business.</p>
<button class="btn" onclick="document.getElementById('platforms').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">Explore NEXORA</button>
</section>

<section class="section" id="platforms">
<h2>Explore Our Ecosystem</h2>
<p class="sub">Everything connected in one place.</p>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card"><div class="emoji">🤖</div><h3>NEXORA AI</h3><p>Your everyday AI assistant for questions, ideas and problem solving.</p><button onclick="openFeature('NEXORA AI')">Explore</button></div>
<div class="card"><div class="emoji">🎨</div><h3>NEXORA CREATE</h3><p>A creative space for images, concepts and inspiration.</p><button onclick="openFeature('NEXORA CREATE')">Explore</button></div>
<div class="card"><div class="emoji">✍️</div><h3>NEXORA WRITE</h3><p>Develop stories, documents, emails and creative writing.</p><button onclick="openFeature('NEXORA WRITE')">Explore</button></div>
<div class="card"><div class="emoji">💻</div><h3>NEXORA CODE</h3><p>Explore programming, software development and coding ideas.</p><button onclick="openFeature('NEXORA CODE')">Explore</button></div>
<div class="card"><div class="emoji">📚</div><h3>NEXORA LEARN</h3><p>Discover knowledge and make learning more accessible.</p><button onclick="openFeature('NEXORA LEARN')">Explore</button></div>
<div class="card"><div class="emoji">📈</div><h3>NEXORA BUSINESS</h3><p>Explore business concepts, planning and innovation.</p><button onclick="openFeature('NEXORA BUSINESS')">Explore</button></div>
<div class="card"><div class="emoji">🌐</div><h3>NEXORA HUB</h3><p>Your central place to explore the NEXORA ecosystem.</p><button onclick="openFeature('NEXORA HUB')">Explore</button></div>
</div>
<div id="message"></div>
</section>
</main>
<footer>© 2026 NEXORA LIFE. The Future, Connected.</footer>
<script>
function openFeature(name){
document.getElementById('message').textContent=name+' — Coming Soon. Stay tuned!';
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
